[C] [G] [C],        Baat kya hai, paata kuch nahin hai
[C] [G],        Mujse koyee khaata ho gayee too
[C] [G] [C],        Is mein meri khaata kuch nahin hai
[C] [F] [C],        Khoobsoorat hai tuu rut javaan hai
[C] [G],        Kaali kaali ghata daar rahi hai
[C] [G] [C],        Thandi aahein hawaa bhar rahi hai
[C] [G],        Sabko kya kya guman ho rahe hai
[C] [G] [C],        Har kalee hum pe saak kar rahi hai
[C] [F] [C],        Phoolon ka dil bhi kuch badgumaan hai
Aaj mausam....................hai,        [C] [G]
Aey mere yaar aey husn wale,        [C] [G] [C]
